{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/789747-spirit-claimed","id":789747,"title":"Spirit-Claimed","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-20T08:30:33-08:00","id":789747,"title":"Spirit-Claimed","content":"Hello!<br /> <br /> I want to allow the players to become Spirit-Claimed, as described in the Book Of Shadows, a being half-human and half-spirit. But I want to do this with some balance, using XP to acquire the Numinas and others abilities. Do you have any sugestion to do this?<br /> <br /> Resuming, this being have access to some Numinas as new abilities and the spirits's Power, Resilience and Resistance is distributed for corresponding attribute.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9723-winchester","name":"winchester","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-20T09:29:22-08:00","id":789784,"title":"","content":"If it is all players then the balance is amongst each other if it is only one you will be ubable to truly have it balanced. Also because it is a blending of mind and body of an otherworldly being it is intended as an antagonist.<br /> <br /> My advise is to try going by the book for the claimed rules and ramp up the game in response - after all if a hunter is being claimed there should be a good reason. Other suggestion is to have all the spirits built on the same base line with player input possibly in the spirits outcome.<br /> <br /> There is a book like changeing breeds but not that book that does present this in a way. The attribute dots that'd be granted would have a pool that could be bought at discounted rates. So that would be one way you could go if you want it to build up. Also remember though that the bond can be severed and let the pcs know if it gets too ridiculous you will have a narrative reason or event to return them to human (applie sanicity of merits to any experience spent however)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-20T17:32:03-08:00","id":789995,"title":"","content":"Skinchangers is the book with rules for the hengeyokai, those empowered by being claimed by fox spirits.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-21T02:44:25-08:00","id":790172,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/789747-spirit-claimed?p=789995#post789995\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Skinchangers is the book with rules for the hengeyokai, those empowered by being claimed by fox spirits.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Siten Uzu, if I recall. The fox spirit is trapped inside Naruto style, so the human side remains the dominant one.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T20:10:07-08:00","id":792506,"title":"","content":"Reading the Immortals book, i guess the Purified template solve my problem!<br /> <br /> Thanks anyway for the help!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9723-winchester","name":"winchester","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T18:22:47-07:00","id":985181,"title":"","content":"Another question envolving this topic: a character want to build something Castiel-like, from Supernatural series.<br /> <br /> I know, he is an Angel (and God-Machine Chronicles introduces it). But he wants to add this supernaturals power in his human character, becoming a template (like vampire, werewolves).<br /> <br /> We are playing a Hunter campaign. I think use the Spirit-Claimed concept to add in his character (maybe a fanatic-religion spirit that possess his body - he is a priest).<br /> <br /> Do you have any suggestions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9723-winchester","name":"winchester","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;